---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Agentic AI Operations" description="How multi-agent systems transform business processes — with BeLeaf as the demo">
  <article class="rabbit-hole">
    <section class="hero-rabbit">
      <a href="/rabbit-holes/" class="back-link">← Rabbit Holes</a>
      <div class="rabbit-tenets">
        <span class="tenet">AI</span>
        <span class="tenet">Insight</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Agentic AI Operations</h1>
      <p class="rabbit-tagline">Multi-agent systems that transform manual processes into autonomous, intelligent workflows</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-label">The Core Insight</h2>
      <div class="insight-box">
        <blockquote>
          "The question isn't 'Will AI replace me?' — it's 'How do I lead a hybrid workforce of humans and synthetic agents?'"
        </blockquote>
        <p>
          By 2026, AI has become infrastructure. But most businesses are still stuck in pilot mode.
          <strong>Agentic AI</strong> is different — these systems don't just generate content, they
          <em>execute multi-step workflows</em> autonomously.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-label">The Pattern</h2>
      <div class="pattern-container">
        <p>The <strong>Converged Multi-Agent Pattern</strong> — practical, enterprise-ready:</p>
        <div class="pattern-visual">
          <div class="agent-card plan">
            <span class="agent-icon">🎯</span>
            <h4>Plan Agent</h4>
            <p>Maps the problem, defines data sources, sets goals</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="agent-card exec">
            <span class="agent-icon">⚙️</span>
            <h4>Execution Agent</h4>
            <p>Builds scripts, calls APIs, processes data in sandbox</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
          <div class="task-agents">
            <div class="agent-card task">
              <span class="agent-icon">📊</span>
              <h4>Task 1</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="agent-card task">
              <span class="agent-icon">🔄</span>
              <h4>Task 2</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="agent-card task">
              <span class="agent-icon">📝</span>
              <h4>Task 3</h4>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="task-label">Parallel sub-tasks with isolated execution</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section demo-section">
      <h2 class="section-label">See It In Action: BeLeaf</h2>
      <div class="beleaf-intro">
        <div class="beleaf-logo">🌿☕</div>
        <h3>Meet BeLeaf</h3>
        <p>
          A synthetic tea & coffee supplier we built to demonstrate these patterns.
          149 employees, £18M revenue, real challenges mapped to real solutions.
        </p>
        <a href="/beleaf/" class="inline-link">Explore BeLeaf →</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="process-selector">
        <h4>Select a process to see transformation:</h4>
        <div class="process-tabs" id="process-tabs">
          <button class="tab active" data-process="inventory">📦 Inventory</button>
          <button class="tab" data-process="customer">💬 Customer Service</button>
          <button class="tab" data-process="supply">🚚 Supply Chain</button>
          <button class="tab" data-process="hr">👥 HR Pipeline</button>
          <button class="tab" data-process="finance">📊 Finance</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="process-content" id="process-content">
        <div class="process-panel active" data-panel="inventory">
          <div class="before-after">
            <div class="before">
              <h5>Before</h5>
              <p>Manual morning counts, spreadsheet updates, gut-feel ordering</p>
            </div>
            <div class="after">
              <h5>After</h5>
              <p>Real-time monitoring with predictive alerts</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics">
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">20-30%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">reduction in stockouts</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">50%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">faster processing</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="key-person"><strong>Key Person:</strong> Carlos Mendez (VP Ops) — "Everything is manual, we're drowning"</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-panel" data-panel="customer">
          <div class="before-after">
            <div class="before">
              <h5>Before</h5>
              <p>Manual cross-referencing, 24-48hr response times</p>
            </div>
            <div class="after">
              <h5>After</h5>
              <p>Instant resolution with intelligent escalation</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics">
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">40%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">faster resolution</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">30%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">churn reduction</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="key-person"><strong>Key Person:</strong> Tom Harrison (Head of CX) — "Amazing feedback data, not sure what to do"</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-panel" data-panel="supply">
          <div class="before-after">
            <div class="before">
              <h5>Before</h5>
              <p>Manual coordination with 50+ vendors, reactive rerouting</p>
            </div>
            <div class="after">
              <h5>After</h5>
              <p>Proactive optimization with route graphing</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics">
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">15-25%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">waste reduction</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">20%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">logistics cost cut</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="key-person"><strong>Key Person:</strong> Anna Kowalski (Procurement) — supply chain volatility pain</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-panel" data-panel="hr">
          <div class="before-after">
            <div class="before">
              <h5>Before</h5>
              <p>8-day onboarding, 40% prospect drop-off, manual screening</p>
            </div>
            <div class="after">
              <h5>After</h5>
              <p>Automated matching with skill-based filtering</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics">
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">50%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">faster time-to-hire</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">4 days</span>
              <span class="metric-label">new onboarding time</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="key-person"><strong>Key Person:</strong> Ahmed Hassan (Talent) — "Tech hiring in Bristol is brutal"</p>
        </div>

        <div class="process-panel" data-panel="finance">
          <div class="before-after">
            <div class="before">
              <h5>Before</h5>
              <p>12-day close, 4 disconnected systems, CFO formatting reports</p>
            </div>
            <div class="after">
              <h5>After</h5>
              <p>Real-time scenario-based forecasting</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics">
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">30%</span>
              <span class="metric-label">accuracy improvement</span>
            </div>
            <div class="metric">
              <span class="metric-value">5 days</span>
              <span class="metric-label">new close time</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="key-person"><strong>Key Person:</strong> James Okonkwo (CFO) — "Close takes 12 days, should take 5"</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-label">The Dashboard Concept</h2>
      <div class="dashboard-mockup">
        <div class="dashboard-header">
          <span class="dashboard-title">BeLeaf Agentic AI Dashboard</span>
          <span class="dashboard-user">Admin: Sarah</span>
        </div>
        <div class="dashboard-body">
          <div class="log-panel">
            <div class="log-title">LIVE AGENT LOG</div>
            <div class="log-entry"><span class="time">10:32:14</span> Plan Agent: Mapping query types...</div>
            <div class="log-entry"><span class="time">10:32:15</span> Exec Agent: Fetching order #BL-2847...</div>
            <div class="log-entry"><span class="time">10:32:16</span> Task Agent: Status verified - SHIPPED</div>
            <div class="log-entry success"><span class="time">10:32:17</span> ✓ Query resolved in 4.2 seconds</div>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics-row">
            <div class="dash-metric">
              <span class="dash-value">247</span>
              <span class="dash-label">Queries Today</span>
              <span class="dash-trend up">↑ 23%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dash-metric">
              <span class="dash-value">4.8s</span>
              <span class="dash-label">Avg Resolution</span>
              <span class="dash-trend down">↓ 82%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="dash-metric">
              <span class="dash-value">12</span>
              <span class="dash-label">Escalations</span>
              <span class="dash-trend down">↓ 65%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-label">Resources</h2>
      <div class="resources-grid">
        <a href="https://medium.com/ai-today/how-to-run-a-hotel-with-agentic-ai-fe09f364e664" target="_blank" class="resource-card">
          <span class="resource-icon">📖</span>
          <h4>Original Article</h4>
          <p>How hotels reap rewards from agentic AI</p>
        </a>
        <a href="https://open.substack.com/pub/shrivu/p/building-multi-agent-systems-part-c0c" target="_blank" class="resource-card">
          <span class="resource-icon">📚</span>
          <h4>Deep Dive</h4>
          <p>Building Multi-Agent Systems (Substack)</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/beleaf/" class="resource-card">
          <span class="resource-icon">🌿</span>
          <h4>BeLeaf</h4>
          <p>Explore the synthetic business</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section cta-section">
      <div class="cta-box">
        <h3>Ready to transform your processes?</h3>
        <p>Let's map your workflows and identify where agentic AI can save you time, money, and sanity.</p>
        <a href="mailto:dave@wordandmouth.com?subject=Agentic%20AI%20Transformation" class="cta-button">Start the Conversation</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="article-footer">
      <div class="related-links">
        <h4>Explore Related</h4>
        <a href="/ai/">AI Tenet →</a>
        <a href="/insight/">Insight Tenet →</a>
        <a href="/rabbit-holes/building-intelligence/">Building Intelligence →</a>
        <a href="/beleaf/">BeLeaf →</a>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');
    const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.process-panel');
    
    tabs.forEach(tab => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const process = tab.dataset.process;
        
        tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
        tab.classList.add('active');
        
        panels.forEach(p => {
          p.classList.remove('active');
          if (p.dataset.panel === process) {
            p.classList.add('active');
          }
        });
      });
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .rabbit-hole {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-rabbit {
    padding: 10rem 2rem 4rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .rabbit-tenets {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tenet {
    background: rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.15);
    color: var(--accent);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .hero-rabbit h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .rabbit-tagline {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .section {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .insight-box {
    background: #111;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .insight-box blockquote {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .insight-box p {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Pattern Visual */
  .pattern-container p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .pattern-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .agent-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 200px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .agent-card.plan { border-color: #4CAF50; }
  .agent-card.exec { border-color: #2196F3; }
  .agent-card.task { border-color: #9C27B0; min-width: auto; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; }

  .agent-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .agent-card h4 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .agent-card p {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .flow-arrow {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .task-agents {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .task-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* BeLeaf Demo */
  .beleaf-intro {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(45, 80, 22, 0.2) 0%, rgba(74, 55, 40, 0.2) 100%);
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid #333;
  }

  .beleaf-logo {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .beleaf-intro h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .beleaf-intro p {
    color: var(--muted);
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Process Tabs */
  .process-selector h4 {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .process-tabs {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .tab {
    background: #111;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .tab:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .tab.active {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* Process Panels */
  .process-panel {
    display: none;
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .process-panel.active {
    display: block;
  }

  .before-after {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .before, .after {
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .before {
    background: rgba(244, 67, 54, 0.1);
    border-left: 3px solid #F44336;
  }

  .after {
    background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.1);
    border-left: 3px solid #4CAF50;
  }

  .before h5, .after h5 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .before p, .after p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .metrics {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .metric {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .metric-value {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .metric-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .key-person {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Dashboard Mockup */
  .dashboard-mockup {
    background: #0a0a0a;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .dashboard-header {
    background: #111;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
  }

  .dashboard-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .dashboard-user {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .dashboard-body {
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .log-panel {
    background: #050505;
    padding: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .log-title {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .log-entry {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .log-entry .time {
    color: #666;
    margin-right: 0.5rem;
  }

  .log-entry.success {
    color: #4CAF50;
  }

  .metrics-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .dash-metric {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .dash-value {
    display: block;
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .dash-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .dash-trend {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .dash-trend.up { color: #4CAF50; }
  .dash-trend.down { color: #4CAF50; }

  /* Resources */
  .resources-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .resource-card {
    background: #111;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .resource-card:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .resource-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .resource-card h4 {
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .resource-card p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a1a 0%, #0f0f0f 100%);
    padding: 3rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid #333;
  }

  .cta-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-box p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #000;
    padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.3);
  }

  /* Footer */
  .article-footer {
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #222;
  }

  .related-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .related-links h4 {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .related-links a {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .related-links a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .before-after {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .metrics-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    
    .task-agents {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
